    BRANCH
        IF `acting with the express consent of a constable`
            THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A person does not commit an offence under any of sections 15 to 18 if he is acting with the express consent of a constable."
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

