    BRANCH
        IF `the facts`'s `makes the disclosure after he becomes concerned in the transaction`
           AND `the facts`'s `makes the disclosure on his own initiative`
           AND `the facts`'s `makes the disclosure as soon as is reasonably practicable`
            THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Subsection (2) applies only where a person makes a disclosure"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

