-- src:98 | (2) Subject to subsections (3) and (4), a person does not commit an offence under any of sections 15 to 18 by involvement in a transaction or arrangement relating to money or other property if he discloses to a constable—
-- src:99 | (a) his suspicion or belief that the money or other property is terrorist property, and
-- src:100 | (b) the information on which his suspicion or belief is based.
@ref s 21(2) (src:98-100)
